  "details": "I keep getting random friend requests from bots advertising a bot net. They advertise the ability to steal avatars and stalk people. I've also noticed bots inviting me to groups, which could be the group paying for those services or it could be a targeted attack.\n\nBecause I noticed that reporting the group was really easy but reporting the bot was a whole ordeal. This will definitely cause more people to report the group than the bot.\n\nNo proposed solution here. Just wanted to make sure it was reported and that you knew about it.",
